# Local environment files. Anything VITE_-prefixed is inlined into the client
# bundle at build time, so treat a committed .env as published either way.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local audit notes. Names live credentials, their files and their commit
# hashes across the other repos — a map worth more to an attacker than any
# single key. Keep it off any remote.
SECURITY-FINDINGS.md

